---
// src/components/features/landing/comp-offer-details.astro
---
<section id="offer" class="snap-section offer-details-section">
  <a href="#top" class="back-to-top" aria-label="Volver al inicio" title="Volver al inicio">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path>
    </svg>
  </a>

  <div class="container offer-container">
    <div class="offer-grid">
      <!-- Qué recibes -->
      <div class="offer-info">
        <div class="offer-badge">
          <span class="offer-badge-icon">✦</span>
          <span class="offer-badge-text">100% GRATIS</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="offer-title">¿Qué recibes en tu Diagnóstico <span class="highlight-title">Gratuito?</span></h2>
        <p class="offer-subtitle">No te enviaré un reporte automático de PDF generado por un robot. Recibirás un diagnóstico real de tu negocio <span class="highlight-offer-sub">hecho a mano por mí.</span></p>
        
        <div class="perks-list">
          <!-- perk 1 (Lupa azul) -->
          <div class="perk-card glass-panel perk-blue">
            <div class="perk-icon-box box-blue">🔍</div>
            <div class="perk-content">
              <h3 class="perk-title">Diagnóstico punto por punto</h3>
              <p class="perk-desc">Analizo tu marca, el copy de tu web, la UX móvil y la velocidad técnica, y te digo exactamente qué está frenando tus ventas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- perk 2 (Diana rosa) -->
          <div class="perk-card glass-panel perk-pink">
            <div class="perk-icon-box box-pink">🎯</div>
            <div class="perk-content">
              <h3 class="perk-title">Prioridades de Acción Claras</h3>
              <p class="perk-desc">Qué debes arreglar primero para tener el mayor impacto en tus ventas, sin gastar de más en agencias ni perder tiempo.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- perk 3 (Regalo amarillo) -->
          <div class="perk-card glass-panel perk-yellow">
            <div class="perk-icon-box box-yellow">🎁</div>
            <div class="perk-content">
              <h3 class="perk-title">Una Mejora de Regalo</h3>
              <p class="perk-desc">Te dejaré una recomendación técnica/copy lista para aplicar hoy mismo por ti mismo, decidas o no trabajar conmigo después.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta del Perfil de Luis destacada -->
      <div class="bio-card glass-panel featured-bio">
        <!-- Patrón de puntos decorativo -->
        <div class="bio-dots-pattern"></div>
        
        <div class="bio-avatar-block">
          <div class="bio-avatar">
            <img src="/assets/asset-luis-avatar.jpg" alt="Luis Niño - Senior Developer & Brand Strategist" class="bio-avatar-img" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="110" height="110" />
          </div>
          <span class="bio-label">Tu Auditor</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bio-content">
          <h3 class="bio-name">Luis Niño</h3>
          <p class="bio-title">Senior Developer & Brand Strategist</p>
          
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/luis-nino-developer/?locale=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bio-linkedin-link">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Conectar en LinkedIn</span>
          </a>
          
          <blockquote class="bio-quote">
            "Programo desde los 15 años en Turbo C. Emigré a Vancouver buscando un futuro mejor, al igual que tú. Mi misión es nivelar la cancha: <strong>hoy</strong>, combinando Inteligencia Artificial con años de experiencia en desarrollo, por fin es posible entregarle al pequeño emprendedor software y marca de nivel premium a un precio accesible."
          </blockquote>
          
          <div class="bio-cta-block">
            <a href="#audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-bio">Iniciar mi auto-auditoría &rarr;</a>
            <span class="bio-lock-notice">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="11" height="11">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 9V7a5 5 0 0110 0v2a2 2 0 012 2v5a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-5a2 2 0 012-2zm8-2v2H7V7a3 3 0 016 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              Sin compromiso · 100% confidencial
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .offer-details-section {
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-slow);
    position: relative;
    padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .back-to-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .back-to-top:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-card-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .offer-container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .offer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .offer-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Badge 100% gratis */
  .offer-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.45);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    width: max-content;
  }

  html[data-theme="brand"] .offer-badge {
    background-color: rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.15);
  }

  .offer-badge-text {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .offer-title {
    font-size: 2.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .highlight-title {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .offer-subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .highlight-offer-sub {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .perks-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Tarjetas Perks a la izquierda */
  .perk-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    border-left: 4px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .perk-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .perk-card.perk-blue {
    border-left-color: #00b4d8;
  }

  .perk-card.perk-pink {
    border-left-color: #ff007f;
  }

  .perk-card.perk-yellow {
    border-left-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .perk-icon-box {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .perk-icon-box.box-blue {
    background-color: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.12);
  }

  .perk-icon-box.box-pink {
    background-color: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.12);
  }

  .perk-icon-box.box-yellow {
    background-color: rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.12);
  }

  .perk-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .perk-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .perk-desc {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* Tarjeta de Biografía Destacada a la derecha */
  .bio-card {
    padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem 1.75rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .featured-bio {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.12);
  }

  html[data-theme="brand"] .featured-bio {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary); /* Borde azul oscuro en modo claro */
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.06);
  }

  .bio-dots-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.25rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--color-accent-primary) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
    background-size: 10px 10px;
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bio-avatar-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .bio-avatar {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
    border: 3.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.25);
    position: relative;
  }

  html[data-theme="brand"] .bio-avatar {
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.15);
  }

  .bio-avatar-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .bio-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .bio-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .bio-name {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.1rem;
  }

  .bio-title {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .bio-linkedin-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.5rem auto;
    width: fit-content;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .bio-linkedin-link:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .bio-quote {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .bio-cta-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-bio {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .bio-lock-notice {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .offer-details-section {
      padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .offer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .offer-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    .back-to-top {
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
